scripts/opencode-talk/0002-indicator-before-footer-status.patch
Pins: opencode-talk v0.1.1 (see build.sh).
Render the recording indicator beside the footer status slot instead of inside
it. OpenCode V2 drops prepend and append claims on a slot that another plugin
replaces, and the pillbox statusline replaces prompt.footer.status, so the
indicator would never show. A before claim sits outside the replaced slot.

--- a/lib/indicator.js
+++ b/lib/indicator.js
@@ -58,7 +58,7 @@
   }
 
   const unclaim = context.ui.slot({
-    prepend: "prompt.footer.status",
+    before: "prompt.footer.status",
     render: () => {
       const el = ui.createElement("text")
       // Take the width the hint needs instead of wrapping inside the footer row.
